AGEBGBbH4jXPg\/wCHHhvw2exvsMw3NgkHFfsh8PNDk8M+GtH8Nx\/2nJp\/h\/TLDR7ObWNQ1PWNXuINPthbK13qmqXl7e3l7nP22+vb7UL\/AFDknOAKv\/lz\/wBvHvw4jzjCZRXyWpX\/AOEzFaab20173tbdx730Z\/\/Z","name":"Lasagna OG","steps":[{"uuid":"7E85B83B-984C-47BE-97DF-DADEA3F74AD2","step":"Preheat the oven to 350°F. Bring a large pot of salted water to a boil. Add the lasagna noodles and cook until al dente (firm) according to package directions. Drain, rinse under cold water, and set aside.","order":0,"isSection":false},{"uuid":"51C739AE-1FAD-4832-9C08-79628B61BDC9","step":"Meanwhile, in a large skillet or Dutch oven, brown the beef, sausage, onion, and garlic over medium-high heat until no pink remains. Drain any fat.","order":1,"isSection":false},{"uuid":"F276F9D4-B9BF-47C3-BE10-D3AFB1781ADD","step":"Stir in the pasta sauce, tomato paste, Italian seasoning,  ½  teaspoon of salt, and  ¼  teaspoon of black pepper. Simmer uncovered over medium heat for 5 minutes or until slightly thickened.  Taste and season with additional salt if desired.","order":2,"isSection":false},{"uuid":"323048CE-00FC-45BB-B458-D62D8B05BD27","step":"In a separate medium bowl, combine  1 ½  cups mozzarella cheese,  ¼  cup parmesan cheese, ricotta, parsley, egg, and  ¼  teaspoon salt.","order":3,"isSection":false},{"uuid":"99707FC2-34A3-4109-9902-C8C57DB1180B","step":"Spread 1 cup of the meat sauce in a 9x13 pan or casserole dish. Top it with 3 lasagna noodles. Layer with 1 cup of the ricotta cheese mixture and 1 cup of meat sauce.  Repeat twice more. Finish with 3 noodles topped with remaining sauce.","order":4,"isSection":false},{"uuid":"16D53924-480A-49A2-8686-2B5B6403E112","step":"Cover with foil and bake for 45 minutes.","order":5,"isSection":false},{"uuid":"49A474CF-410C-4413-8977-D86C653C3102","step":"Remove the foil and sprinkle the top of the lasagna with 2 ½ cups mozzarella cheese and ¼ cup Parmesan cheese. Bake uncovered for an additional 15 minutes or until browned and bubbly. Broil for 2-3 minutes if desired.","order":6,"isSection":false},{"uuid":"D8D22DBC-EF51-4AD0-9199-6DF76E34F5CB","step":"Rest for at least 15 minutes before cutting.","order":7,"isSection":false}],"folderIDs":[],"neutritionalInfo":"Protein: 29 g,\nCarbohydrates: 28 g,\nCholesterol: 71 mg,\nFiber: 2 g,\nSodium: 857 mg,\nFat: 16 g,\nSugar: 4 g,\nSaturated Fat: 7 g,\nServing Size: 1 serving,\nCalories: 377 kcal","isPublicRecipe":false,"defaultScale":1,"sourceName":"spendwithpennies.com"}